#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:258
msgid "4 解释器模式"
msgstr "4 Interpreter Mode"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:260
msgid ""
"解释器的核心价值在于**隔离硬件差异**。通过环境变量 `TRITON_INTERPRET=1` "
"强制Triton在CPU上执行kernel计算，其结果可作为判断NPU计算精度的基准。"
msgstr ""
"The core value of the interpreter is to **isolate hardware"
"differences**. You can set the environment variable `TRITON_INTERPRET`"
"to `1` to forcibly execute kernel computation on the CPU. The result of"
"the kernel computation can be used as the benchmark for determining the"
"NPU computation accuracy."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:262
msgid "**使用方法：**"
msgstr "**Usage:**"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:264
msgid "设置环境变量`TRITON_INTERPRET=1`并运行程序，使Triton kernel在CPU解释器上执行。"
msgstr ""
"1. Set the environment variable `TRITON_INTERPRET` to `1` and run the"
"program so that the Triton kernel is executed on the CPU interpreter."
"2. Insert a Python breakpoint at the position to be checked in the"
"Triton kernel source code."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:265
msgid "在Triton kernel源码中需要检查的位置插入Python断点："
msgstr ""
"1. Set the environment variable `TRITON_INTERPRET` to `1` and run the"
"program so that the Triton kernel is executed on the CPU interpreter."
"2. Insert a Python breakpoint at the position to be checked in the"
"Triton kernel source code."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:271
msgid "程序执行到此处会暂停并进入Python调试器 (`Pdb`)。可以打印和检查任意中间变量的值："
msgstr ""
"3. The program execution is paused and you enter the Python debugger"
"(`Pdb`). You can print and check the value of any intermediate variable."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:277
msgid ""
"注：解释器模式会在 CPU 上执行所有计算，显著降低运行效率。因此，在完成调试或验证后，务必取消设置环境变量 "
"TRITON_INTERPRET，或显式将其设为 0，确保系统性能不受影响："
msgstr ""
"Note: The interpreter mode performs all computations on the CPU, which"
"significantly reduces the running efficiency. Therefore, after debugging"
"or verification, you must cancel the setting of the environment variable"
"**TRITON_INTERPRET** or explicitly set it to **0** to ensure that the"
"system performance is not affected."

