"Small log size: usually dozens to hundreds of lines, which are easy to"
"read."
"Focus on high-level logic: applicable to debugging operator conversion,"
"memory layout, and parallel policies."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:453
msgid "**使用建议** 日常调试首选：90% 的 Triton 算子问题可通过此日志定位 配合 `TRITON_DEBUG=1` 可进一步增强信息"
msgstr ""
"**Suggestion:**"
"First choice for routine debugging: This log can be used to locate 90%"
"of Triton operator issues."
"It can be used together with `TRITON_DEBUG=1` to further enhance"
"information."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:457
msgid "**启用方式**"
msgstr "**Enabling method:**"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:465
msgid "5.2.2.2 `TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG=1`"
msgstr "5.2.2.2 `TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG=1`"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:467
msgid "**功能** 启用 LLVM 后端 CodeGen 阶段的全量调试日志，包括指令选择、寄存器分配、指令调度、机器码生成等底层过程。"
msgstr ""
"**Function:**"
"Enables full debugging logs in the LLVM backend CodeGen phase, including"
"instruction selection, register allocation, instruction scheduling, and"
"machine code generation."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:470
msgid ""
"**特点** 日志量极大：单个 kernel 可产生数万行输出 极底层细节：包含寄存器名、物理/虚拟寄存器映射、栈帧布局等 仅限 LLVM "
"专家：对普通 Triton 开发者通常为“噪声”"
msgstr ""
"**Feature:**"
"Large log size: A single kernel can generate tens of thousands of lines"
"of output."
"Bottom-layer details: Register name, physical/virtual register mapping,"
"and stack frame layout are included."
"Only for LLVM experts: For common Triton developers, this is considered"
"\"noise.\""

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:475
msgid "**使用建议** 仅在怀疑 LLVM 后端 bug 时启用（如生成非法指令、性能异常） 配合 LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY 限制输出范围"
msgstr ""
"**Suggestion:**"
"Enable this function only when LLVM backend bugs are suspected (for"
"example, invalid instructions are generated or performance exceptions"
"occur)."
"It can be used together with LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY to limit the output scope."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:479
msgid ""
"在启用 `TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG=1` 时，可通过 `LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY` "
"环境变量指定仅输出特定模块的调试日志。以下是常用 `DEBUG_TYPE` 的简要解释："
msgstr ""
"When `TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG=1` is enabled, you can use the"
"`LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY` environment variable to specify the module for which"
"the logs will be output. The following is a brief description of the"
"common `DEBUG_TYPE`:"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:508
msgid "**启用方式** 以指定仅输出`isel`为例"
msgstr ""
"**Enabling method:**"
"In the following example, it is specified that only `isel` is output."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:517
msgid ""
"**调试流程推荐** 先启用 `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=1` → 验证 MLIR 层转换是否正确（如 ReduceOp → "
"scf.for） 若 MLIR 正常但结果错误 → 怀疑 LLVM 问题，再启用 `TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG=1 + "
"LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY` 避免直接开启 `TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG=1` → "
"日志过大易掩盖关键信息，且严重影响运行速度"
msgstr ""
"**Recommended debugging process:**"
"Enable `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=1` first."
"→ Check whether the conversion at the MLIR layer is correct (for"
"example, ReduceOp → scf.for)."
"If the MLIR is normal but the result is incorrect:"
"→ It is suspected that the LLVM is faulty. Enable"
"`TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG=1 + LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY`."
"Do not directly enable `TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG=1`."
"→ Large log size may mask key information and severely affect the"
"running speed."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md:525
msgid "附录 A：常用环境变量速查表"
msgstr "Appendix A: Quick Reference Table for Common Environment Variables"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "变量"
msgstr "Variable"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "作用"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "`TRITON_DEBUG=1`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DEBUG=1`"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "启用中间 IR 转储"
msgstr "Enables intermediate IR dump."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "`TRITON_DISABLE_CACHE=1`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DISABLE_CACHE=1`"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "禁用编译缓存"
msgstr "Disables compilation cache."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "`TRITON_INTERPRET=1`"
msgstr "`TRITON_INTERPRET=1`"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "使用 CPU 解释器执行 kernel"
msgstr "Uses the CPU interpreter to execute the kernel."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "启用运行时打印输出，同时也会启用编译时打印输出"
msgstr "Enables runtime print output and compilation print output."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "`MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=1`"
msgstr "`MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=1`"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "启用 MLIR 高层 IR 的自动 dump。在每个 MLIR Pass 执行前后，将当前函数的 IR 以可读文本形式输出"
msgstr "Enables automatic dump of the MLIR high-level IR and outputs the IR of the current function in readable text before and after each MLIR pass is executed."

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG=1`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG=1`"

#: ../../zh/debug_guide/debugging.md
msgid "启用 LLVM 后端 CodeGen 阶段的全量调试日志，包括指令选择、寄存器分配、指令调度、机器码生成等底层过程"
msgstr "Enables full debugging logs in the LLVM backend CodeGen phase, including instruction selection, register allocation, instruction scheduling, and machine code generation."
